WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.350
(marching music)

00:00:28.509 --> 00:00:31.461
- [Narrator] In Chile, there
is an army of reenactors,

00:00:31.461 --> 00:00:33.359
dedicated to studying specific events

00:00:33.359 --> 00:00:35.461
that occurred during World War II

00:00:35.461 --> 00:00:39.628
and replicating them with
Hollywood-like accuracy.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:15.417
(shouting)
(guns firing)

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:55.011
- [Narrator] While the
reenactors vary in age,

00:01:55.011 --> 00:01:57.491
background and occupation,
they're joined together

00:01:57.491 --> 00:02:00.491
by their mutual interest in history.

